# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  .gitignore — dart_ts_generator
#  Covers both the Dart package side and the TypeScript/Node side.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Dart ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.dart_tool/
.packages
pubspec.lock        # commit in apps, ignore in packages
build/
doc/api/

# ── TypeScript / Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# Compiled output — committed to git so git-dependency TS consumers get it,
# but ignored from npm (handled by .npmignore dist/ NOT being listed here).
# If you prefer not to commit dist/, uncomment the next line:
# dist/

# ── Generated TS output ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# gen/ IS committed — it is the source for tsc and for git-based TS consumers.
# Do NOT add gen/ here.

# ── Misc ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
coverage/
example/dist/
example/gen/
docs/